OpenSSL
Version: 3.5.8 LTS
Source: https://www.openssl.org/
Source package: openssl-3.5.8.tar.gz

Build type: Static

linux_amd64:
- Target: linux-x86_64
- Compiler: GCC
- Shared libraries: disabled
- Tests: disabled
- Apps: disabled
- Docs: disabled
- OpenSSL directory: /etc/ssl
- System CA directory: /etc/ssl/certs

win64_mingw:
- Target: mingw64
- Cross compiler prefix: x86_64-w64-mingw32-
- Compiler: MinGW-w64 GCC
- Shared libraries: disabled
- Tests: disabled
- Apps: disabled
- Docs: disabled

Included files:
- Public OpenSSL headers for each platform
- libssl.a
- libcrypto.a

Notes:
- Headers are stored per platform because some OpenSSL headers are generated during configuration and may be target-specific.
- Static libraries are intended for use by WFZ components and bundled third-party libraries.
- The Linux build uses /etc/ssl as OPENSSLDIR so OpenSSL can use the host system CA certificate store.

